OL,3,AMPs recommend BBC charter renewal is
OL,4,Ascrapped and licence fee is extended
OL,5,Abeyond TV
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe BBC licence fee should be extended
OL,8,Fto cover services other than TV and the
OL,9,Fcorporation's charter review should be
OL,10,Fscrapped and made permanent, an
OL,11,Finfluential group of MPs has said.
OL,13,FThe report from the House of Commons'
OL,14,Fcross-party culture and media committee
OL,15,Fcomes ahead of the government
OL,16,Ffinalising its proposals for the next
OL,17,FBBC royal charter later this year,
OL,18,Fwhich will set out how the broadcaster
OL,19,Fis funded, regulated and governed from
OL,20,F2028.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
