SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790849905
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMPs recommend BBC charter renewal is
OL,4,Ascrapped and licence fee is extended
OL,5,Abeyond TV
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn its recommendations, the DCMS
OL,8,Fcommittee also said that political
OL,9,Fappointments to the BBC board should
OL,10,Fend, to improve public trust.
OL,12,FThe report also said the next charter
OL,13,Fshould be made permanent, so that the
OL,14,FBBC's funding and existence is not
OL,15,Fcalled into question every 10 years.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
